{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09525","headline":"同孙构免官後登蓟楼 · 张谓","name":"同孙构免官後登蓟楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔在五陵时，年少心亦壮。\n尝矜有奇骨，必是封侯相。\n东走到营州，投身似边将。\n一朝去乡国，十载履亭障。\n部曲皆武夫，功成不相让。\n犹希虏尘动，更取林胡帐。\n去年大将军，忽负乐生谤。\n北别伤士卒，南迁死炎瘴。\n濩落悲无成，行登蓟丘上。\n长安三千里，日夕西南望。\n寒沙榆塞没，秋水滦河涨。\n策马从此辞，云山保闲放。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}